flowchart TD
    Define[Define actor outcome, paths, state, invariants] --> Ready{Ready for bounded work?}
    Ready -->|No| Research[Spike, source, decide, or classify unknown]
    Research --> Define
    Ready -->|Yes| Delegate[Dispatch session or human work]
    Delegate --> Implement[Implement smallest vertical slice]
    Implement --> Validate[Run claim-appropriate evidence]
    Validate --> Pass{Claims proven?}
    Pass -->|No| Diagnose[Find model, code, contract, or evidence defect]
    Diagnose --> Refine[Refine definition and implementation]
    Refine --> Validate
    Pass -->|Yes| Review[Review model, code, artifacts, and risk]
    Review --> Baseline[Commit, baseline, or release]
    Baseline --> Learn[Observe real behavior]
    Learn --> Define
